  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NLM-Mental health Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical support of rehabilitation activities at the mental health hospital in Medan, Indonesia, trainings of stakeholders within community-based rehabilitation in the Helvetia district,  awareness raising within mental disabilities, and establishment of a network for actors within mental healthcare.</narrative>
